# Agent worktrees are throwaway checkouts of this same repo living inside the
# repo root. Changes in them must never trigger hooks against the main tree.
# Covers any agent that follows the convention (.claude, .codex, .cursor, ...).
# Scoped to dot-directories on purpose: a plain **/worktrees/** would also
# swallow a real source package named "worktrees".
.*/worktrees/**
